			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Mountain submodule — Remove dead IPC and internal modules\n\nUpdate Mountain submodule to commit 68fa97ee, which eliminates unused submodules from the ApplicationState, IPC, and ProcessManagement layers. Remove dead `PathResolution`, `Recovery`, `Serialization` in Internal; `Message`, `Connection`, `Encryption`, `Security`, `WindAirCommands`, `WindServiceAdapters`, and `Permission` in IPC; plus `WorkspaceContainsGlob` in ProcessManagement.\n\nCondense module documentation to focused summaries, removing migration roadmaps and legacy notes. Preserve only actively-used modules.\n\nThis cleanup reduces noise in the module tree and ensures only live code paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "341634d76289200d5d8d29c74e8b20d33bdf0215"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
