			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				27,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Common submodule — Restore Effect module for ActionEffect system\n\nUpdate Common submodule to commit aa6701d8, which re-adds the Effect module to the public API in Library.rs. This module defines the core ActionEffect trait and associated types that power Common's abstract effect system used across Mountain, Cocoon, and other elements.\n\nThe module was previously removed during a deprecation pass but is needed as the foundational abstraction for the editor's effect-based architecture.",
			"SHA": "81892edef7583b8a89009463ff248f2ea5a170de"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T17:05:52Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				27,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Remove deprecated transport layers and RPC scaffolding\n\n**Common** (refactor): Delete the deprecated `Effect` module and all transport implementation modules (gRPC, IPC, WASM, Registry, Metrics, Retry, CircuitBreaker) along with their DTO components. Keep only core modules (Environment, Error) and the Common transport interface.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Eliminate unused module declarations including legacy `Hover`, `DefaultConfigurations`, `NLSResolver`, the `Enhanced` subdirectory, and 11 dormant RPC scaffolding modules (Types, EchoAction, Commands, Workspace, Configuration, Windows, Terminals, Debug, SCM, Processes, Telemetry). Condense `Source/RPC/mod.rs` documentation to describe only the active `CocoonService` surface.\n\nThis cleanup removes dead code following the architectural migration to new IPC and telemetry patterns, reducing noise in the module tree and ensuring only actively-used paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "ddf572e383d0d4668786e21be607862852ffaffa"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T16:29:29Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
