				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Mountain submodule — Normalize import separations in Vine and Git handlers\n\nUpdate Mountain submodule to commit 54102e9d, which completes the absolute-path migration by finalizing import statement cleanup in `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `Source/Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs`. Apply the established two-line import pattern to separate `::Vine::Error` and `::Vine::Generated` type imports from local `crate::` bindings.\n\nAlso normalize Git service handlers in `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/` by using single-line consolidated imports for local modules in `HandleRevListCount` and `HandleRevParse`, and expand multi-line `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()` calls to block style in `HandleExec` and `HandleRevParse` for improved readability.\n\nThis finalizes the import normalization across all gRPC service handlers, ensuring consistent separation between canonical library imports and local project bindings.",
			"SHA": "39f31afac27182ffb496644f510f29af94186102"
		}
